  "description": {
   "en": "Six years ago, Natsuki Yura was summoned to another world as a hero. After defeating the Demon King and finally managing to return to his original world, he discovered that Earth was actually full of fantasy too—psychics, aliens, angels, gods, you name it.",
   "ja": "6年前、異世界に勇者として召喚された由良夏樹。魔王を倒し、やっとの思いで元の世界に帰還した。だが、地球も実は霊能力者、異星人、天使、神様とかなりのファンタジーで――。現代超ファンタジー開幕!!"
  },
